msgctxt "96"
msgid "Urgh... No more..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "108"
msgid ""
"What, already? Guess the Nishikiyama Family crest is too\r\n"
"heavy for you after all."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "120"
msgid "Hrgh..."
msgstr "Ugh..."

msgctxt "132"
msgid ""
"The hell were you thinkin' trying to kidnap this girl!? What\r\n"
"happened to yakuza having pride, huh!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "144"
msgid ""
"Look, it's not what you're thinking! Our boss just sent us\r\n"
"out on the prowl for the biggest girl we could find, and⑬"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "156"
msgid "Whaddya mean \"big\"? This girl's tiny..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "168"
msgid "That aside, what was Kanda planning to do to her?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "180"
msgid "Well, uh... He needed the girl for his hobby."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "192"
msgid ""
"You callin' sexual assault a hobby!? The fuck is wrong with\r\n"
"you!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "204"
msgid "Please, just hear me out!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "216"
msgid ""
"The boss's got this weird fetish, see... He has us drag\r\n"
"girls back to the office so he can massage them! It's\r\n"
"nothing more than that, I promise!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "228"
msgid "Is this some kinda joke?"
msgstr "È una specie di scherzo?"

msgctxt "240"
msgid ""
"No, I'm totally for real! The boss loves nothing more than\r\n"
"massaging a nice, big woman! The thicker, the better!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "252"
msgid "You believin' this garbage, Aniki?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "264"
msgid "What does Kanda get out of all that?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "276"
msgid ""
"I dunno, aroused? I get kinda sick if I dwell on it too much,\r\n"
"but I bet he loves hearing 'em moan while he does it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "288"
msgid ""
"Our only job is finding girls big enough to handle his\r\n"
"massive, meaty hands."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "300"
msgid "And that's why you were trying to kidnap her?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "312"
msgid ""
"Yeah, that's it! I swear! Nothing assault-y about it,\r\n"
"promise!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "324"
msgid ""
"You realize that's still assault, right? Anyway, whaddya\r\n"
"think, Aniki? Should we believe him?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "336"
msgid ""
"Hard to say... but I doubt anyone would make up such an\r\n"
"embarrassing story. Especially about their own boss."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "348"
msgid ""
"We're just following orders, honest. Truth is, just thinking\r\n"
"of the boss and his hobby makes me wanna hurl to high\r\n"
"heavens, but if he says we get a girl, we get a girl."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "360"
msgid "...All right. We'll let you go this time."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "372"
msgid "Whoa, you mean it!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "384"
msgid "Under one condition. Tell us where Kanda is."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "396"
msgid "What're you gonna do to him?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "408"
msgid "That's none of your business."
msgstr "Fatti gli affari tuoi!"

msgctxt "420"
msgid "Urgh..."
msgstr "Urgh..."

msgctxt "432"
msgid "Now come on. We're in a hurry here."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "444"
msgid ""
"All right, all right. He's in the Hotel District, little\r\n"
"place called the Red Brick."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "456"
msgid "...Right."
msgstr "...Ok."

msgctxt "468"
msgid ""
"So if I'm gettin' this right, he asked you to haul a girl\r\n"
"over to this love hotel so he could... massage her?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "480"
msgid ""
"That's about the thick of it. Sounded like the boss was real\r\n"
"happy 'bout something, too. Guess things're going good."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "492"
msgid ""
"That's why he's going all out today for a hotel room\r\n"
"instead of just bringing 'em to the office like normal."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "504"
msgid "...What room is he in?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "516"
msgid "It's, uh... 403."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "528"
msgid ""
"Got it, room 403 at the Red Brick Hotel. And you're sure\r\n"
"that's right?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "540"
msgid "Yup."
msgstr "Già."

msgctxt "552"
msgid "Then go. We're done with you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "612"
msgid "Hey, you okay?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "624"
msgid "I think so, thanks."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "636"
msgid ""
"If you hadn't come when you did, I would have been in for\r\n"
"a pretty rough massage..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "648"
msgid ""
"Though you know, my shoulders have actually been kinda sore\r\n"
"lately. Maybe I should've gone with them, hehe!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "660"
msgid "Uh..."
msgstr "Ehm..."

msgctxt "672"
msgid ""
"Anyway, thanks. I really appreciate you stepping in when\r\n"
"you did."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "684"
msgid "Nah, it was nothin'. Any guy would've done the same."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "696"
msgid ""
"I'm not so sure about that. By the way, um... could I have\r\n"
"your contact info? I was thinking maybe I could pay you back later, if that's all right."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "708"
msgid ""
"Oh, uh! You don't gotta do that, ma'am! Be glad to give you\r\n"
"my name, though⑬it's Rikiya."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "720"
msgid "We need to get moving here."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "732"
msgid "Hey, wait a sec, Aniki!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "744"
msgid "Sorry, guess I gotta run. Keep yourself safe, ya hear?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "756"
msgid "Anikiii! Wait up!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "792"
msgid "...So you're Nishikiyama Family, huh?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "804"
msgid ""
"Heh, damn right we are! Well? Those big britches of yours feelin' a little "
"tighter now?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "816"
msgid "...Not exactly. You guys are just small-time street thugs."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "828"
msgid "We're what!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "840"
msgid "Nice work, Rikiya."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "852"
msgid "Uh... Whaddya mean, Aniki?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "864"
msgid "These are just the guys I was looking for."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "876"
msgid "What're you two babblin' about over there, huh!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "888"
msgid ""
"I'll explain later, Rikiya. There's a fly buzzing in my ear\r\n"
"that I'd really like to swat."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "900"
msgid ""
"Lemme help, at least! I'm the one they were messin' with in\r\n"
"the first place, y'know."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "912"
msgid "Fine by me. The more the merrier."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "924"
msgid "You think you're hot shit, scumball!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "936"
msgid "Hmph. You bottom-rungers never change, do you?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "948"
msgid "What was that!?"
msgstr "Cosa hai detto?"

msgctxt "960"
msgid ""
"All you do is hide behind your family crest like it's some\r\n"
"kind of shield. But it's not. You're not tough. You're small."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "972"
msgid "Oh yeah!? I'm bigger than you, fuckface!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "984"
msgid "Then prove it."
msgstr ""

